               "Initialize the second-order task residual with a full gain.\n\n"
               "The residual is\n"
               "  r = a + K(v - g(y))\n\n"
               "where a is the task acceleration, v is the task rate, and "
               "g(y) is the guidance output.\n\n"
               "The Jacobians are\n"
               "  Rx = Ax + K(Vx - Ge Yx)\n"
               "  Ru = Au + K(Vu - Ge Yu)\n"
               "where Ge = dg/dy.\n"
               ":param task: task model\n"
               ":param guidance: guidance model\n"
               ":param gain: full task gain matrix"))
